  "description": "Salt Security Azure App Service Site Extension that automatically collects HTTP traffic for security analysis. Multi-target support for .NET 6.0 and 8.0. Uses ASP.NET Core IHostingStartup to inject middleware without code changes. Zero-latency fire-and-forget pattern with circuit breaker protection. IMPORTANT: After installation, you must add 3 Application Settings to activate the extension. See package README for configuration instructions.",
